  m_text: Spells are a bit more complex. Each consumes some mana (you have 100 total)
    and they have a bunch of different effects. Press the alphanumeric 0 on your
    keyboard (Above O and P) to buy the fireball and assign it a key.\n Then burn
    the next ghost!\nAgain, this one is vulnerable only to the fireball.
